        <mxCell id="f31" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;fontStyle=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="Every change to a permission, setting, or on/off switch is automatically recorded — who changed what, and when — so nothing here is ever a silent edit." vertex="1">
